<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xml:lang="en"><generator uri="https://jekyllrb.com/" version="4.4.1">Jekyll</generator><link href="https://christianodenwald.github.io/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/atom+xml"/><link href="https://christianodenwald.github.io/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" hreflang="en"/><updated>2026-04-14T11:45:26+00:00</updated><id>https://christianodenwald.github.io/feed.xml</id><title type="html">blank</title><subtitle>A simple, whitespace theme for academics. Based on [*folio](https://github.com/bogoli/-folio) design. </subtitle><entry><title type="html">a post to remind myself how to edit this website</title><link href="https://christianodenwald.github.io/blog/2026/jekyll-alfolio/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="a post to remind myself how to edit this website"/><published>2026-03-20T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-03-20T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://christianodenwald.github.io/blog/2026/jekyll-alfolio</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://christianodenwald.github.io/blog/2026/jekyll-alfolio/"><![CDATA[<h4 id="to-see-changes-locally">to see changes locally</h4> <p>run</p> <div class="language-c++ highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="n">bundle</span> <span class="n">exec</span> <span class="n">jekyll</span> <span class="n">s</span> <span class="o">-</span><span class="n">l</span>
</code></pre></div></div> <h4 id="what-to-edit">what to edit</h4> <h5 id="for-publications">for publications</h5> <p><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">_bibliography/papers.bib</code></p> <h5 id="for-blogposts">for blogposts</h5> <p>add a file to <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">_posts</code></p> <h4 id="helpful-links">helpful links</h4> <p><a href="https://alshedivat.github.io/al-folio/">The original template</a></p>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="notes"/><category term="tutorial"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[I do it so rarely so I forget]]></summary></entry></feed>